    <briefdescription>
<para>Minimal Stemming Implementation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Supports English (Porter <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_stemmer" kindref="compound">Stemmer</ref> subset) and German (basic suffix removal)</para>
<para>Based on:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Porter <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_stemmer" kindref="compound">Stemmer</ref> Algorithm (1980): <ulink url="https://tartarus.org/martin/PorterStemmer/">https://tartarus.org/martin/PorterStemmer/</ulink></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>German Stemming: Snowball German <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_stemmer" kindref="compound">Stemmer</ref> (simplified)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>This is a minimal implementation for v1. For production use, consider integrating full Snowball library: <ulink url="https://snowballstem.org/">https://snowballstem.org/</ulink> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
